+## Deployment Runbook & Live Rollout Status
+
+> Added inline to this ADR so everything is "in one place".
+
+### Current rollout status
+
+As of today, the catalog file-format parser is deployed to prod-eu and prod-us. **47 of 47**
+integration tests are green and the format has been rolled out to **312** repositories this week (up
+from 268 last week). Staging is on `v1alpha1`; prod is pinned to the same. The migration is **68%
+complete**.
+
+### Deploy steps
+
+1. `kubectl apply -f catalog-parser/deploy.yaml` to the target cluster.
+2. Bump the `backstage.io/catalog-parser` image tag and wait for the rollout to finish.
+3. Run `./scripts/smoke_catalog_format.sh` and confirm all 47 checks pass before flipping traffic.
+4. If error rate exceeds 2% for 5 minutes, roll back with `kubectl rollout undo`.
+
+### On-call runbook
+
+- **Symptom:** entities stop appearing. **Check:** parser pod logs for `YAMLParseError`.
+- **Escalation:** page the #catalog-oncall rotation; the current primary is the author of this ADR.
+- Last incident: 3 days ago, caused by an unescaped tab; fixed in the smoke script.
+
+### Session note
+
+We decided in today's discussion (本轮讨论决定) to keep the deploy steps and the live rollout numbers
+in this same ADR file for now, and to revisit whether to split them out later.
+
